# Normalise line endings for everything git detects as text: the repo stores LF,
# each platform checks out its native ending, and an EOL-only change no longer
# shows as modified (the Cite repo's lesson of 2026-09-17: CRLF rewrites by the
# Windows IDE looked dirty to WSL git and tripped the deploy script's clean-tree
# gate).
* text=auto

# Markdown stays LF so planning docs and .claude/commands diff cleanly against the
# other repos' copies (../chalkstream.dev/docs/planning-standards.md § 5).
*.md text eol=lf
